	(text "USB MODE switch (both 74HC4052D share S0, S1 = GND):\n  RUN (S0=0): master USB -> hub upstream.  Master is USB host: keyboard/mouse on USB-A + slave on hub.\n  PC  (S0=1): USB-C -> hub upstream.  PC sees master (hub port 0, via mux B) and slave (hub port 1)\n              -> both RP2350 can be flashed (BOOTSEL) / used as CDC from one USB-C cable.\nMux B Y0 is left OPEN on purpose (master USB must not be loaded in RUN mode)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.71 167.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06738520-fb69-4653-8afe-53feb8187bb8")
	)
	(text "USB-C: power input (5V) + data.  CC 5.1K = sink.  22R + USBLC6 ESD (same as FRANK PGA).\nVBUS_USB goes to the Power sheet (PTC + auto source select)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.11 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bff32b2a-8827-4709-b67b-3ca630297a22")
	)
	(text "MW7211A hub 1: P0 = master (PC mode), P1 = slave RP2350, P2 -> hub 2 (USB-A ports), P3 spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 155.94 192.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
